  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Objective


    Your goal is to gather all the items on your Grocery List
    as fast as possible.

    Navigate the aisles, find the groceries, and avoid
    any obstacles or hazards.


    UI Elements

    Panic Meter: Watch your panic
    meter! If it fills up,.

    Grocery List: Displays the items you need to collect.

    Circular
    Dash Meter: Shows your dash cooldown. When the meter is full, you can dash again.


    Grocery
    Placement

    Items are placed randomly across the grocery store. Explore different
    aisles to find them.


    Enemies

    NPCs: Avoid certain NPCs who may block
    your path. Some might move along set paths, so time your moves carefully.


    Winning

    Once
    you''ve collected all the items on your grocery list, make your way to the checkout
    counter to complete the level. You will be given the option to go into another
    day to play the game again'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
